# Green Pilot Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Google Identity Services Client ID (Web application)
# Must match GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID configured on the backend.
# The Google OAuth client must have Authorized JavaScript Origins matching this host:
#   Development: http://localhost:5173
#   Production:  https://app.greenpilot.in
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
